@startuml
title D-05 Payment, Fiscal, and Reconciliation Reporting Flow

actor "Finance /\nRevenue Assurance User" as Finance
participant "Central PMS" as CPMS
participant "Payment Orchestrator /\nPayments Domain" as Pay
participant "Site POS Server" as POS
participant "Reconciliation Workflow" as Recon
participant "Management Dashboard" as Dash

CPMS -> Dash : TariffSnapshot,\nPaymentAttempt,\nPaymentConfirmation,\nfiscal issuance reference
Pay -> Dash : ProviderOutcome evidence
POS -> Dash : Authorized fiscal document\nreference/report summary
Recon -> Dash : Reconciliation run,\nitem status,\nsettlement comparison
Finance -> Dash : Review revenue,\nfiscal, and reconciliation views

note over Dash
Financial dashboards use canonical payment,
provider, fiscal, and reconciliation records.
Projection-only session counts must be excluded
or clearly labeled as operational estimates.
end note
@enduml
